{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kittenship Care is a cozy life-sim where you nurture, train, and play with adorable kittens. Create a purr-fect space and keep your furry friends happy in a relaxing, interactive sandbox. No stress\u2014just whiskers, cuddles, and kitten fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Foster Cute Cats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/CuteCatsezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1742410875\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make Them Feel Loved</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/PettingGif-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1742410875\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build the Purr-fect House</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/BuildingGif-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1742410875\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help Them Find Their Forever Home</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/Adoptionezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1742410875\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Adopt &amp; Care for Kittens</strong> \u2013 Choose from a variety of kittens and tend to their needs in a cozy, interactive environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Arrange &amp; Decorate Your Space</strong> \u2013 Place furniture and design your space to create the perfect home for your furry friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Meet Their Needs</strong> \u2013 Keep your kittens happy by providing food, water, and a comfortable place to rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expand Your Home</strong> \u2013 With each successful adoption, unlock new rooms to build out and customize your ever-growing cozy space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relaxing &amp; Cozy Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Enjoy a soothing gameplay experience with charming visuals and ambient sounds.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3597770?t=1742410875","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3597770?t=1742410875","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/2ddca3aa0924a4a2e71b9413b67419462f0bb396/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742410875","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/2ddca3aa0924a4a2e71b9413b67419462f0bb396/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742410875","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kittenship Care is a cozy life-sim where you nurture, train, and play with adorable kittens. Create a purr-fect space and keep your furry friends happy in a relaxing, interactive sandbox. No stress\u2014just whiskers, cuddles, and kitten fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Foster Cute Cats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/CuteCatsezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1742410875\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make Them Feel Loved</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/PettingGif-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1742410875\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build the Purr-fect House</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite